                    <nc xml:id="m-24724f9b-135a-49d1-b445-9bb23dc9df28" pname="c" oct="4" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-aeaba0ba-d818-4876-8db7-c2b9c0e983f5">
              <lg xml:id="m-b9420c97-795c-4ace-a73d-0fbacfa91b9d">
                <l xml:id="m-a9ce8c69-7fc0-4c89-a554-5ff33143d3d4" facs="#m-8a58d340-b9f2-4602-b86e-cd690a6fe981" label="ambiguous">·=</l><l xml:id="m-f9265a82-fe3a-4c66-af72-bc72cae7a5c7" facs="#m-12a070da-3fc5-4ebd-9a3a-935dab833470" label="text-like">The Common Commemorations of Saints.</l><l xml:id="m-8edc9302-3a10-4e20-ae47-cac4f50e32e0" facs="#m-2fbb4699-8a74-4cc6-80d9-dae1d9a796f1" label="ambiguous">262"</l><l xml:id="m-5b99caa5-18b2-4774-b65b-b5369452c639" facs="#m-5e8c8dba-4382-457e-835b-2ab78c3365ab" label="text-like">If a Commemoration is to be made from another Office which has the same</l><l xml:id="m-f2c65dba-4a16-471b-934d-548c02e19513" facs="#m-db1dfdeb-cdc0-41bd-ada2-3c4bea4123c8" label="text-like">Antiphon, it is said</l><l xml:id="m-a4225c8d-c3fa-4ce6-b7da-458acf9e5083" facs="#m-dadd9826-05ce-4958-8c20-6226b2465cac" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-e8eb39a3-6d93-413c-8d6e-5bb6de4c29f6" facs="#m-1acb2f77-5126-4063-8712-050d8ca8fb87" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-4cc99bf2-b7f4-40bc-9a10-fbd43ec76f81" facs="#m-dafbc57b-7cd2-49fc-a623-654a043c97da" label="lyrics-like">U- ge “sérve bóne et fi-dé-lis, qui-a in páuca</l><l xml:id="m-874cc14f-5f15-4d3f-8765-ccfc1848921c" facs="#m-39224ae9-5078-4c32-a907-f522d8f4be13" label="lyrics-like">fu-ísti fi-dé-lis, supra múlta te constí-tu-am: intra in</l><l xml:id="m-e92883f6-5eae-4b9d-aa58-6baa55e04a60" facs="#m-27e886e3-2faf-43f8-9fc5-e8fec0997ecc" label="lyrics-like">gáudi-um Dómi-ni tú¬ i P. T. Alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-dfe6a279-a8a3-4d26-b5b0-f2dc16b2a1c6" facs="#m-b27e5d5b-75d6-4637-ae0c-76236026bcd1" label="lyrics-like">V. Jústum dedúxit. above. If it has already been said:</l><l xml:id="m-dedc1a28-7716-4b89-9bd0-781a4f79ae80" facs="#m-d918b00c-04dd-448f-973d-2d7a55d87a0f" label="lyrics-like">V. Os jústi meditábitur sapiéntiam. (P. T. Alleluia.)</l><l xml:id="m-a5d89fe3-068e-4078-8b0b-a683b63c7b00" facs="#m-1df546ef-220b-4590-b737-67f1c0b9eea5" label="lyrics-like">R. Et lingua éjus loquétur judicium. (P. T. Alleluia.)</l><l xml:id="m-fa2b9a09-1432-4629-9281-6f79fb9d70eb" facs="#m-51dab6b9-0c0f-41ea-a27a-a893cf4ae47a" label="text-like">FOR A VIRGIN</l><l xml:id="m-8247efee-3c41-4858-b1ac-fc753894e482" facs="#m-80baa5a3-fd6d-42b3-b226-5d6a1212a256" label="text-like">At I. Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-e5fb5733-2dab-46d3-b817-b62d7f7b7465" facs="#m-fad031b6-59b6-427d-9c12-8beaca8cde55" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-d6068ac3-0f52-4665-bcd7-e8882f98bec2" facs="#m-a223b387-cc88-4403-a1a5-289db884a8bd" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-53d63985-ee79-41a4-836c-67447ddf8d1a" facs="#m-4509ebef-bd93-4d3b-b681-63abb6010414" label="ambiguous">Y</l><l xml:id="m-3731bdf0-3de7-45ca-a8b9-c188b87d8f06" facs="#m-a73eb917-8d43-4856-bdb1-5e9d45d9befa" label="lyrics-like">Eni spónsa Chrísti, áccipe co-ró-nam, quam tí¬</l><l xml:id="m-847620c1-36da-42c3-8cd3-cb88cb3f02f3" facs="#m-6aa88582-74b4-487c-996d-313d3c3d70d5" label="lyrics-like">bi Dómi-nus praeparávit in aetérnum. P. T. Alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-29f1cf81-feec-4efa-823c-b1ea4bad49eb" facs="#m-80a10fc6-72b5-44be-a7b3-7b1df229b68d" label="lyrics-like">V. Spécie túa et pulchritúdine túa. (P. T. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-a515562c-4cc9-4b99-9c6b-fabe1a81a905" facs="#m-ad728a9c-a23a-49eb-a402-9dd40543face" label="lyrics-like">K. Inténde, próspere procéde, et régna. (P. T. Allélúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-606a07c8-1c30-43d8-93ac-f0e660e54feb" facs="#m-b9544041-bf9a-4853-b964-26af954b1c36" label="text-like">At H. Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-e4f9e305-7ef1-47e1-a994-e48f83552309" facs="#m-0407246b-7a29-472e-8bb0-dfb88328333a" label="ambiguous">ant.</l><l xml:id="m-adbf2d68-d42e-43f1-9bbf-d2b2d90e9b9a" facs="#m-a5d18958-15db-4532-9fa2-9d344556adf8" label="lyrics-like">Eni spónsa Chrísti, * áccipe corónam, quam tí-bi</l><l xml:id="m-5fb6de3a-96f6-469a-a4a8-dfd08a05e73e" facs="#m-b362453a-22f8-4a95-b99f-8c455163e6a3" label="ambiguous">⬪</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>